# Per-profile website blocking configuration
# Format: profile_name|domain1,domain2,domain3
#
# Domains listed here will be blocked for the profile's devices
# when website-blocking.sh enable <profile> is called.
#
# The profile names must match those in /etc/config/parental_profiles
# The MACs are read from parental_profiles, not from this file.

# Alice: block YouTube and TikTok
alice|youtube.com,www.youtube.com,tiktok.com,www.tiktok.com

# Bob: block TikTok and Snapchat
bob|tiktok.com,www.tiktok.com,snapchat.com,www.snapchat.com

# Teen: block Reddit during study time
teen|reddit.com,www.reddit.com